    dict(key='15-act-4-figure', kind='figure', title='One failure, three places',
         body='responses',
         narration="Fourth demo: what the customer is told, and what the log keeps. [[slnc 400]] The fraud check drops the connection, and the bank must answer. [[slnc 700]] On the left, Spring Boot's own error response, with the debugging settings switched on. [[slnc 300]] Status five hundred. [[slnc 300]] It carries the internal address, the full card number, and lines of code. [[slnc 300]] A map of the bank. [[slnc 700]] In the middle, the same failure with one error handler. [[slnc 300]] Status five oh three, none of those details, and a short message with a reference. [[slnc 700]] On the right, the log line. [[slnc 300]] The same reference, the reason, and only the last four digits of the card. [[slnc 300]] Support finds the detail. [[slnc 300]] An attacker learns nothing."),
